Owned audience platform choice
title end

paragraph start
Choose the tool that holds the email list by what it must do: store consent records, send to a list, let people unsubscribe and export the list. Compare tools on those needs, on how they handle subscriber data and on cost, each with its source and date.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The list belongs to the brand, so the tool must allow a full export at any time. Consent and unsubscribe rules are confirmed on the legal pages before the first signup form goes live.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
tool, consent records, unsubscribe, export, data handling, cost, source, date checked
code end

